WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru
kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi
no koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.750 --> 01:00.060
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:03.690
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
<b>Let it go, Shinjiyou</b>

01:37.560 --> 01:39.150
<b>How boring.</b>

01:41.030 --> 01:44.160
<b>To Dr. Huang, whose only redeeming
quality is her seriousness...</b>

01:45.500 --> 01:46.970
<b>What's that?</b>

01:50.010 --> 01:53.140
<b>That box, what's in it?</b>

01:53.140 --> 01:58.880
<b>A toy my brain came up with which
plays with people's hearts.</b>

02:24.440 --> 02:26.040
<b>We're here, we're here.</b>

02:26.040 --> 02:29.380
<b>Which means food, Hakkai!</b>

02:29.380 --> 02:32.710
<b>There's still quite a ways
to go until dinnertime,</b>

02:32.710 --> 02:34.080
<b>but I guess we can ask them quickly.</b>

02:34.080 --> 02:36.690
<b>Please! I'm about to die here!</b>

02:36.690 --> 02:38.350
<b>Sounds interesting!</b>

02:38.350 --> 02:40.820
<b>If you can die just from getting
hungry, I'd be curious to see it.</b>

02:41.590 --> 02:43.060
<b>What's wrong, Goku?</b>

02:47.830 --> 02:48.300
<b>Goku!</b>

02:48.300 --> 02:50.730
<b>Hey, monkey, are you
seriously dying?!</b>

02:50.730 --> 02:53.260
<b>Hang in there! I'll go get
you some food!</b>

02:54.070 --> 02:58.230
<b>What?! Then get me pot stickers!
Get them to take out the garlic!</b>

03:02.140 --> 03:04.110
<b>Dr. Ni...</b>

03:04.110 --> 03:09.280
<b>I'll acknowledge you're one of the
finest scientists in the world.</b>

03:09.280 --> 03:13.660
<b>Well, well, I'm quite honored.</b>

03:13.660 --> 03:17.690
<b>However, we're in the service
of Lady Gyokumen Koushu.</b>

03:17.690 --> 03:19.190
<b>Taking action without permission...</b>

03:19.190 --> 03:22.130
<b>Dr. Huang, you were a
class committee chairman</b>

03:22.130 --> 03:24.130
<b>in grade school, weren't you?</b>

03:24.130 --> 03:25.900
<b>Why are you bringing this up now?</b>

03:28.240 --> 03:29.640
<b>Bullseye.</b>

03:29.640 --> 03:33.010
<b>A perpetual spring bubbling</b>

03:33.010 --> 03:35.610
<b>in a desert of ignorance,
incompetence, and chaos</b>

03:35.610 --> 03:39.410
<b>will only be swallowed up
by the dry, dry desert.</b>

03:40.220 --> 03:45.990
<b>Even if one single woman greedily
tries to drink that spring dry...</b>

03:45.990 --> 03:50.160
<b>Are you listening? More springs
will emerge, one after another,</b>

03:50.160 --> 03:53.160
<b>to be swallowed up by the desert.</b>

03:53.160 --> 03:54.720
<b>What a pity.</b>

03:55.260 --> 03:57.830
<b>Are you trying to say
you're the spring?</b>

03:57.830 --> 04:01.430
<b>I don't want to be sucked into
the desert for no purpose.</b>

04:03.940 --> 04:06.410
<b>The queen bee I created.</b>

04:06.410 --> 04:09.310
<b>A product of my hobby, made
during my off-duty hours.</b>

04:10.680 --> 04:14.650
<b>You don't actually intend to
use that against Genjo Sanzo?</b>

04:14.650 --> 04:16.850
<b>You're going to act independently
without any orders?</b>

04:16.850 --> 04:19.120
<b>Please don't let it bother
you too much.</b>

04:20.760 --> 04:23.950
<b>Go on now. The worker bees
are already out scouting.</b>

04:25.960 --> 04:27.430
<b>Bye-bye.</b>

04:38.570 --> 04:41.940
<b>Unfortunately, it seems this
inn doesn't serve meals.</b>

04:42.880 --> 04:44.410
<b>The village apparently
has a food shortage</b>

04:44.410 --> 04:46.640
<b>due to lack of water and dry weather.</b>

04:48.650 --> 04:51.790
<b>Hey, Gojyo, go procure food for us.</b>

04:51.790 --> 04:53.590
<b>Why me?!</b>

04:53.590 --> 04:55.660
<b>You just said it a minute ago yourself.</b>

04:55.660 --> 04:59.530
<b>"Hang in there! I'll go
get you some food!"</b>

04:59.530 --> 05:02.160
<b>Well, that's because this monkey
played a trick on us.</b>

05:02.160 --> 05:04.260
<b>A man never goes back on his word.</b>

05:04.900 --> 05:06.400
<b>Are you serious?!</b>

05:06.400 --> 05:07.870
<b>See you later.</b>

05:09.000 --> 05:11.270
<b>Fine, I'm going! Happy?!</b>

05:12.210 --> 05:13.670
<b>You're coming too!</b>

05:23.220 --> 05:25.450
<b>Man, what a rundown village.</b>

05:35.560 --> 05:37.500
<b>Please! Just a little!</b>

05:38.200 --> 05:42.800
<b>Go on home! I've got nothing
here to sell to you!</b>

05:42.800 --> 05:44.640
<b>Please! I have a...</b>

05:44.640 --> 05:46.140
<b>Shut up!</b>

05:48.480 --> 05:51.810
<b>I'd sooner throw things in the
trash than sell them to you!</b>

05:52.680 --> 05:54.950
<b>Please! Please!</b>

05:54.950 --> 05:57.920
<b>Hey, Mister, that's no
way to treat a cutie.</b>

05:58.820 --> 06:00.290
<b>What the hell?!</b>

06:02.120 --> 06:05.150
<b>You... Your hair... The
color of your eyes...</b>

06:15.200 --> 06:17.110
<b>What the heck?</b>

06:17.110 --> 06:19.040
<b>Looks like it's free.</b>

06:27.480 --> 06:29.650
<b>Is there something written on my face?</b>

06:29.650 --> 06:32.050
<b>Yeah, it says you like women.</b>

06:32.050 --> 06:34.280
<b>Oh, I guess it's because of that then.</b>

06:35.290 --> 06:36.760
<b>What do you want to do?</b>

06:40.830 --> 06:42.300
<b>Guess we'll go look elsewhere.</b>

06:52.940 --> 06:54.410
<b>Very nice.</b>

06:55.880 --> 07:00.140
<b>This village is swollen
with hatred and fear.</b>

07:07.060 --> 07:09.760
<b>Why is every single shop no good?</b>

07:09.760 --> 07:12.230
<b>I'm hungry. Hey, Gojyo...</b>

07:12.230 --> 07:13.690
<b>Shut up, monkey.</b>

07:15.800 --> 07:17.290
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:27.510 --> 07:29.370
<b>Hey, it's that lady.</b>

07:30.680 --> 07:33.050
<b>Is there something written on my face?</b>

07:33.050 --> 07:34.540
<b>Pervert.</b>

07:35.220 --> 07:36.680
<b>All right.</b>

07:38.720 --> 07:40.880
<b>I'm sorry for my rudeness earlier.</b>

07:41.590 --> 07:45.260
<b>It's no big deal. We should always
help those who're in trouble.</b>

07:45.260 --> 07:49.200
<b>I was so surprised. I wasn't
thinking clearly.</b>

07:50.370 --> 07:52.890
<b>Encounters sometimes come
about in sudden ways.</b>

07:53.470 --> 07:55.000
<b>What's your name?</b>

07:55.000 --> 07:56.770
<b>Yanming...</b>

07:56.770 --> 07:59.370
<b>I'm Sha Gojyo. You can call me Gojyo.</b>

08:01.880 --> 08:03.340
<b>This isn't going anywhere.</b>

08:12.390 --> 08:14.910
<b>Burning red eyes...</b>

08:16.190 --> 08:17.780
<b>A taboo child.</b>

08:20.060 --> 08:23.130
<b>Children born between
humans and demons</b>

08:23.130 --> 08:25.660
<b>have crimson eyes and crimson hair.</b>

08:48.890 --> 08:50.390
<b>It's terrible!</b>

08:51.230 --> 08:52.750
<b>Yanming has allies?!</b>

08:53.430 --> 08:55.630
<b>There's no knowing what'll happen
if we just leave things alone!</b>

08:55.630 --> 08:57.260
<b>I'm gathering the other
villagers right now!</b>

08:58.000 --> 08:59.570
<b>That bitch!</b>

08:59.570 --> 09:01.600
<b>I got it! I'll be right there!</b>

09:01.600 --> 09:03.810
<b>But don't you have some customers?!</b>

09:03.810 --> 09:06.170
<b>Just a shady monk and his
party! Nothing to worry about!</b>

09:08.240 --> 09:09.710
<b>I wonder if something happened?</b>

09:10.310 --> 09:13.510
<b>Who knows? At any rate, those
two sure are taking their time.</b>

09:14.550 --> 09:18.110
<b>Knowing Gojyo, he's probably
hitting on a woman somewhere.</b>

09:19.050 --> 09:21.450
<b>I doubt it, since the brat's with him.</b>

09:23.290 --> 09:24.760
<b>I'm starving.</b>

09:25.290 --> 09:28.060
<b>Oh, Goku, welcome back.</b>

09:28.060 --> 09:29.530
<b>Where's Gojyo?</b>

09:37.740 --> 09:40.730
<b>I see. So your baby is...</b>

09:41.910 --> 09:44.900
<b>And that's why you were
looking at my red eyes.</b>

09:46.080 --> 09:47.650
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:47.650 --> 09:49.880
<b>This is the first time I've
seen someone</b>

09:49.880 --> 09:52.480
<b>in the same circumstances
living respectably.</b>

09:53.090 --> 09:55.320
<b>Living respectably?</b>

09:57.790 --> 09:59.260
<b>Maybe you're right.</b>

10:00.660 --> 10:03.030
<b>Either way, I'm alive after all.</b>

10:07.640 --> 10:09.540
<b>And? What about your boyfriend?</b>

10:10.310 --> 10:13.070
<b>The thing is, one day,</b>

10:13.810 --> 10:16.710
<b>it was like he suddenly turned
into a different person.</b>

10:16.710 --> 10:18.740
<b>Damn, it's the same everywhere.</b>

10:19.410 --> 10:24.120
<b>He disappeared from the village
that day, never to be seen again.</b>

10:24.120 --> 10:29.020
<b>The villagers were kind and told
me that none of it was my fault,</b>

10:29.020 --> 10:31.080
<b>so I continued to lead a normal life.</b>

10:32.430 --> 10:34.860
<b>But I was with child...</b>

10:35.730 --> 10:38.630
<b>I knew what would happen
if I bore him.</b>

10:38.630 --> 10:41.630
<b>A baby with eyes as
red as the sunset.</b>

10:42.300 --> 10:43.870
<b>He has such an appetite.</b>

10:43.870 --> 10:48.440
<b>He's always hungry.</b>

10:48.440 --> 10:49.910
<b>Looking so adorable...</b>

10:50.850 --> 10:54.280
<b>Damn it, I can't stand to
see a woman crying.</b>

10:56.320 --> 10:59.220
<b>Because mother would always
look at me and cry.</b>

11:07.400 --> 11:09.500
<b>Just leave this stupid village.</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:12.830
<b>No, this village is his home.</b>

11:12.830 --> 11:14.320
<b>I must wait for him.</b>

11:16.840 --> 11:18.310
<b>Hey, over here!</b>

11:19.440 --> 11:23.210
<b>Be careful! That Yanming called
in one of her monster friends.</b>

11:24.610 --> 11:26.080
<b>They're the villagers.</b>

11:27.380 --> 11:30.280
<b>Damn, looks like there's
going to be trouble.</b>

11:52.210 --> 11:55.980
<b>Now, there's the crossroad
of sorrow and hatred.</b>

11:55.980 --> 11:58.610
<b>Hurry, my queen bee.</b>

12:08.990 --> 12:10.220
<b>Food...</b>

12:10.220 --> 12:12.050
<b>Gojyo certainly is late in coming back.</b>

12:12.790 --> 12:14.900
<b>Shall we go for a walk and look
for him while we're at it?</b>

12:14.900 --> 12:16.990
<b>Yeah, I'm out of cigarettes too.</b>

12:20.300 --> 12:23.970
<b>So, the hoodoo brought
in another jinx!</b>

12:23.970 --> 12:27.540
<b>That's why we should've chased
her out of the village sooner!</b>

12:27.540 --> 12:29.410
<b>Yeah, no kidding!</b>

12:29.410 --> 12:30.880
<b>What a bunch of bastards.</b>

12:31.650 --> 12:34.110
<b>Wait! He has nothing to do with me!</b>

12:34.650 --> 12:36.950
<b>You're not fooling us!</b>

12:36.950 --> 12:39.590
<b>You're gonna call your friends and
take over the village, aren't you?!</b>

12:39.590 --> 12:42.160
<b>Thanks to you giving birth
to that monster,</b>

12:42.160 --> 12:46.250
<b>this village hasn't seen a drop of rain,
and the wells have dried up!</b>

12:46.890 --> 12:48.900
<b>Even the people of
neighboring villages</b>

12:48.900 --> 12:51.600
<b>are too scared of the red-eyed
baby to come near us!</b>

12:51.600 --> 12:53.230
<b>It's all your fault!</b>

12:53.230 --> 12:55.270
<b>Hey, you got that all wrong!</b>

12:55.270 --> 12:58.170
<b>The whole of Shangri-La
has gone haywire!</b>

12:58.610 --> 13:01.440
<b>Like we're going to believe the
rubbish a monster tells us!</b>

13:01.440 --> 13:02.910
<b>That's just great!</b>

13:03.880 --> 13:05.380
<b>You gonna fight, monster?!</b>

13:05.380 --> 13:06.650
<b>Hurry up and leave!</b>

13:06.650 --> 13:09.480
<b>Please stop! What did we
ever do to hurt you?!</b>

13:12.990 --> 13:16.120
<b>Sorrow is hatred turned inside out.</b>

13:16.120 --> 13:18.130
<b>Now, release yourself.</b>

13:18.130 --> 13:21.320
<b>Turn your despair into
power and explode.</b>

13:23.200 --> 13:24.970
<b>What's the matter, Yanming?</b>

13:24.970 --> 13:26.430
<b>Hey, what's wrong?!</b>

13:29.000 --> 13:30.470
<b>Yanming!</b>

13:42.280 --> 13:44.810
<b>I feel good. I've been reborn.</b>

13:48.760 --> 13:49.690
<b>Yanming!</b>

13:49.690 --> 13:51.090
<b>What's going on?!</b>

13:51.090 --> 13:53.290
<b>That woman was a demon after all!</b>

13:54.730 --> 13:57.320
<b>I'll pay you back for all
you've done to me!</b>

14:01.140 --> 14:02.870
<b>Yanming, stop it!</b>

14:02.870 --> 14:03.770
<b>Shut up!</b>

14:03.770 --> 14:05.240
<b>Damn monster!</b>

14:06.570 --> 14:08.700
<b>You bastard, what're you doing?!</b>

14:12.850 --> 14:14.310
<b>Shoot!</b>

14:19.050 --> 14:20.290
<b>Goku!</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:22.460
<b>What're you doing? What about food?</b>

14:22.460 --> 14:24.460
<b>Gojyo, give me a smoke.</b>

14:24.460 --> 14:26.720
<b>I'm busy right now! Later!</b>

14:28.700 --> 14:30.490
<b>Is that demon the lady
we saw earlier?!</b>

14:31.230 --> 14:33.700
<b>Gojyo, what's going on here?!</b>

14:33.700 --> 14:37.270
<b>I don't know, but Yanming's human.</b>

14:37.270 --> 14:39.270
<b>I didn't sense any demonic
aura from her.</b>

14:39.270 --> 14:41.740
<b>If you're going to stand in my way,
I'll take you down too!</b>

14:42.840 --> 14:44.310
<b>Sounds like fun! Wanna fight?!</b>

14:44.850 --> 14:46.350
<b>Stay out of this!</b>

14:46.350 --> 14:50.250
<b>Yanming, attacking the villagers
isn't going to change anything!</b>

14:51.320 --> 14:53.080
<b>Taboo child!</b>

14:53.790 --> 14:56.690
<b>Children born between
humans and demons</b>

14:56.690 --> 14:58.520
<b>will bring great misfortune with them!</b>

15:04.000 --> 15:05.470
<b>A baby?</b>

15:06.800 --> 15:08.290
<b>So that's it?</b>

15:08.940 --> 15:12.910
<b>The source of all this hatred
is that taboo child!</b>

15:12.910 --> 15:14.670
<b>If only that taboo child didn't exist!</b>

15:25.420 --> 15:26.890
<b>If only he didn't exist!</b>

15:29.390 --> 15:31.720
<b>You know that's not right!</b>

15:36.460 --> 15:37.930
<b>Gojyo, what're you doing?!</b>

15:38.630 --> 15:40.100
<b>Sanzo!</b>

15:43.640 --> 15:44.640
<b>Move away!</b>

15:44.640 --> 15:48.370
<b>Stop it! I've suffered enough
grief for the both of us!</b>

15:53.250 --> 15:56.510
<b>There's no mother who thinks
her own child is ugly.</b>

15:58.190 --> 15:59.650
<b>Isn't that right?!</b>

16:12.430 --> 16:13.900
<b>Mr. Gojyo...</b>

16:15.400 --> 16:18.170
<b>Isn't that right, Yanming?</b>

16:18.170 --> 16:19.760
<b>Mr. Gojyo, please run!</b>

16:20.740 --> 16:21.740
<b>Yanming!</b>

16:21.740 --> 16:24.070
<b>There's nothing I can do now!</b>

16:24.980 --> 16:26.650
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

16:26.650 --> 16:28.710
<b>I don't want to hurt my baby either.</b>

16:29.680 --> 16:33.420
<b>But my body has a will of its own!</b>

16:35.890 --> 16:37.360
<b>That's...</b>

16:37.930 --> 16:39.430
<b>Yanming!</b>

16:39.430 --> 16:41.450
<b>I... I...</b>

16:42.560 --> 16:45.460
<b>I'll send all who stand in my
way to their deaths!</b>

16:46.130 --> 16:47.600
<b>Yanming!</b>

16:51.410 --> 16:53.770
<b>Gojyo! Sanzo!</b>

16:53.770 --> 16:55.640
<b>We got no choice but to kill her!</b>

16:55.640 --> 16:57.340
<b>Stay out of this!</b>

16:59.710 --> 17:02.150
<b>I'll save Yanming!</b>

17:02.920 --> 17:05.720
<b>He's only got Yanming for a mother!</b>

17:05.720 --> 17:08.960
<b>I don't want him to
suffer like I did,</b>

17:08.960 --> 17:13.730
<b>not to mention he won't survive
without his mother at his age!</b>

17:13.730 --> 17:15.200
<b>This is the end!</b>

17:19.430 --> 17:20.900
<b>Come on!</b>

17:35.150 --> 17:36.620
<b>Gojyo!</b>

17:38.390 --> 17:39.850
<b>Gojyo...</b>

17:47.830 --> 17:49.300
<b>Gojyo!</b>

18:08.820 --> 18:11.890
<b>Gojyo! You okay, Gojyo?!</b>

18:11.890 --> 18:13.850
<b>It's okay. He's alive.</b>

18:16.390 --> 18:19.290
<b>So you noticed it, Gojyo.</b>

18:19.290 --> 18:20.780
<b>Looks like it.</b>

18:21.930 --> 18:25.370
<b>I don't get what happened at all.</b>

18:25.370 --> 18:28.960
<b>It's this thing. It's what was
manipulating Miss Yanming.</b>

18:31.470 --> 18:34.980
<b>Gojyo created an opening for
himself by making her attack</b>

18:34.980 --> 18:36.910
<b>and attacked the source then.</b>

18:41.050 --> 18:43.050
<b>That's real reckless!</b>

18:43.050 --> 18:45.520
<b>I agree,</b>

18:45.520 --> 18:49.460
<b>but there are things worth
protecting, even recklessly.</b>

18:57.460 --> 19:00.100
<b>Unburnable trash goes over there.</b>

19:00.100 --> 19:02.370
<b>Yes, Ma'am, Miss Class
Committee Chairman.</b>

19:02.370 --> 19:04.430
<b>Please stop calling me that!</b>

19:11.450 --> 19:13.410
<b>Well, this is goodbye.</b>

19:14.220 --> 19:16.480
<b>Are you really going by yourself?</b>

19:16.480 --> 19:20.420
<b>I'm not alone. I have him.</b>

19:20.420 --> 19:24.060
<b>Will you be all right? The
world's a dangerous place.</b>

19:24.060 --> 19:26.060
<b>I'm a mother.</b>

19:26.060 --> 19:29.050
<b>I must give him the courage
to live strongly.</b>

19:29.730 --> 19:32.600
<b>I'd fail as a mother if I were
constantly afraid.</b>

19:32.600 --> 19:34.540
<b>I'm sad to be leaving the village,</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:38.610
<b>but I'm going to search
for his father myself.</b>

19:38.610 --> 19:41.110
<b>But you know, right now,
Shangri-La is...</b>

19:41.110 --> 19:44.410
<b>If it comes down to it, I'll turn into
the bee woman again and fight.</b>

19:45.410 --> 19:47.440
<b>Those stingers really hurt.</b>

19:48.180 --> 19:49.650
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:57.420 --> 19:59.420
<b>Ni! Isn't Ni around?!</b>

20:00.630 --> 20:03.400
<b>Yes, my Lady Gyokumen Koushu.</b>

20:03.400 --> 20:04.530
<b>Oh, there you are.</b>

20:04.530 --> 20:08.700
<b>After all, you're always in
my thoughts, My Lady.</b>

20:08.700 --> 20:11.270
<b>I'm so bored.</b>

20:11.270 --> 20:14.580
<b>Well, well, that IS a problem.</b>

20:14.580 --> 20:17.210
<b>Do you have something
to entertain me with?</b>

20:17.210 --> 20:20.010
<b>Well, no, because all my time</b>

20:20.010 --> 20:24.520
<b>is consumed with serving you,
Lady Gyokumen Koushu.</b>

20:24.520 --> 20:27.020
<b>Say, I have a favor to ask of you.</b>

20:27.020 --> 20:28.020
<b>Anything, My Lady.</b>

20:28.020 --> 20:29.760
<b>I'm thirsty.</b>

20:29.760 --> 20:32.790
<b>Oh, then I shall bring you
something chilled to drink.</b>

20:32.790 --> 20:36.560
<b>Yes, would you go fetch
it from a desert spring?</b>

20:36.560 --> 20:39.570
<b>And plenty of it, just for me.</b>

20:39.570 --> 20:41.030
<b>Oh, dear...</b>

20:43.100 --> 20:49.510
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou
na kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:49.510 --> 20:54.880
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:54.880 --> 21:00.390
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

21:00.390 --> 21:03.760
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:03.760 --> 21:09.600
<b>Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:09.600 --> 21:15.000
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:20.340
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:20.340 --> 21:24.280
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:31.290 --> 21:34.920
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:34.920 --> 21:36.890
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:36.890 --> 21:41.000
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.000 --> 21:45.130
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:45.130 --> 21:47.800
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:47.800 --> 21:52.840
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa
tonariawase de</b>

21:52.840 --> 21:58.280
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:58.280 --> 22:03.720
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

22:03.720 --> 22:07.740
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
